\#*\#
.#*

# Merge and backup leftovers
*.orig
*.bak

# Claude Code: the session-start hook and its registration are shared, so a
# fresh agent session can run `make check` without guessing at the setup.
# Everything else under .claude/ is per-developer — including
# settings.local.json, which `.claude/*` already covers.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
